# Tamara + Tabby BNPL Integration

Add Tamara (Buy Now Pay Later) and Tabby (Pay in 4) as payment gateways to the Rabeq Express Store, fully integrated with the existing payment infrastructure.

## §0 Mismatch Report

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The integration guide (§0/§1) assumes a `PaymentGatewayInterface`, a `PaymentGatewayFactory`, and a polymorphic driver pattern. **None of these exist.** Here's what the codebase actually has:

| Guide assumption | Reality | Decision |
|---|---|---|
| `PaymentGatewayInterface` contract | Monolithic [PaymentGatewayService](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/app/Services/PaymentGatewayService.php#10-301) class with Stripe-specific methods | **Extend the existing class** — add Tamara/Tabby methods alongside Stripe methods. Creating an interface now would require refactoring all existing Stripe code and the controllers that depend on it, violating the "no changes to existing business logic" rule. |
| `PaymentGatewayFactory` resolver | No factory — `OrderLifecycleService.placeOrder()` has inline `if (paymentMethod === 'stripe')` branching | **Add `tamara`/`tabby` branches** at the same level. |
| `verifyWebhook()` on interface | Stripe uses `Stripe\Webhook::constructEvent()` in [StripeWebhookController](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/app/Http/Controllers/StripeWebhookController.php#13-187) — no shared interface | **Each webhook controller self-verifies** (Tamara: notification token, Tabby: custom header). No shared method needed. |
| PayPal webhook controller | PayPal integration is incomplete — no webhook controller, `paypal_enabled` setting exists but no PayPal checkout flow | No impact on this work. |
| `gateway_order_id`, `gateway_status`, `gateway_payload` on Order | Only `payment_gateway` and `payment_intent_id` exist | **Add via migration.** |
| Separate `PaymentGatewaySettings` Filament page | Existing [PaymentGatewaysPage](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/app/Filament/Pages/Settings/PaymentGatewaysPage.php#15-243) handles Stripe/PayPal/COD/Bank/Shipping | **Add Tamara/Tabby sections to the existing page** — same pattern, same `payment.*` key prefix. |

---

## Proposed Changes

### Database Migration

#### [NEW] [add_bnpl_fields_to_orders_table.php](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/database/migrations/2026_07_01_000001_add_bnpl_fields_to_orders_table.php)
Add three columns to `orders`:
- `gateway_order_id` (string, nullable) — Tamara's `order_id` or Tabby's `payment.id`
- `gateway_status` (string, nullable) — raw status from gateway (`approved`, `AUTHORIZED`, etc.)
- `gateway_payload` (json, nullable) — last webhook payload for debugging

