### Order Model

#### [MODIFY] [Order.php](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/app/Models/Order.php)
- Add `gateway_order_id`, `gateway_status`, `gateway_payload` to `$fillable`
- Add `'gateway_payload' => 'json'` to `$casts`

---

### Payment Gateway Service

#### [MODIFY] [PaymentGatewayService.php](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/app/Services/PaymentGatewayService.php)
Add new methods (alongside existing Stripe methods):
- `createTamaraSession(Order $order): array` — POST to Tamara API, returns `checkout_url` + `order_id`
- `authoriseTamaraOrder(string $tamaraOrderId): array` — critical post-approval step
- `createTabbySession(Order $order): array` — POST to Tabby API, returns `checkout_url` + session [id](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/app/Models/Order.php#123-127)
- `captureTabbyPayment(string $paymentId, float $amount): array`
- `getTabbyPayment(string $paymentId): array` — GET payment status
- Helper: `getTamaraConfig(): array`, `getTabbyConfig(): array` — reads from `Setting::get()` with decrypt
- Update [getAvailableGateways()](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/app/Services/PaymentGatewayService.php#12-84) — wire `tamara_enabled`/`tabby_enabled` from settings (replacing hardcoded `false`)

---

### Order Lifecycle Service

#### [MODIFY] [OrderLifecycleService.php](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/app/Services/OrderLifecycleService.php)
In [placeOrder()](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/app/Services/OrderLifecycleService.php#26-292), after the existing Stripe/Wallet/COD branching (~line 148–284):
- Add `tamara`/`tabby` cases:
  1. Create the order with `payment_status: 'unpaid'`, `status: 'pending'`, `payment_gateway: 'tamara'|'tabby'`
  2. Call `PaymentGatewayService::createTamaraSession()` or `createTabbySession()`
  3. Store `gateway_order_id` on the order
  4. Return `checkout_url` in payment result (frontend redirects)
  5. Clear cart immediately (order is created, payment pending — same as bank_transfer pattern)

