### Routes

#### [MODIFY] [web.php](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/routes/web.php)
Add webhook routes alongside existing Stripe webhook (CSRF-exempt):
```php
Route::post('/webhooks/tamara', [TamaraWebhookController::class, 'handle'])
    ->withoutMiddleware([VerifyCsrfToken::class])
    ->name('webhooks.tamara');

Route::post('/webhooks/tabby', [TabbyWebhookController::class, 'handle'])
    ->withoutMiddleware([VerifyCsrfToken::class])
    ->name('webhooks.tabby');
```

#### [MODIFY] [api.php](file:///c:/wamp64/www/Laravel/eseven-store/routes/api.php)
Add callback routes inside the checkout group:
```php
Route::any('tamara/callback', [CheckoutController::class, 'tamaraCallback']);
Route::any('tabby/callback', [CheckoutController::class, 'tabbyCallback']);
```

